{"s":31,"v":[{"t":"Alif, Lām, Meem.","w":[["الٓمٓ","Alif Lam Meem","alif-lam-meem",""]]},{"t":"These are verses of the wise Book,","w":[["تِلْكَ","These","til'ka","",[["تِ",279],["لْ",0],["كَ",0]]],["ءَايَـٰتُ","(are) Verses","āyātu",""],["ٱلْكِتَـٰبِ","(of) the Book","l-kitābi","",[["ٱلْ",2],["كِتَـٰبِ",63]]],["ٱلْحَكِيمِ","the Wise","l-ḥakīmi","",[["ٱلْ",2],["حَكِيمِ",133]]]]},{"t":"As guidance and mercy for the doers of good","w":[["هُدًۭى","A guidance","hudan",""],["وَرَحْمَةًۭ","and a mercy","waraḥmatan","",[["وَ",1],["رَحْمَةًۭ",121]]],["لِّلْمُحْسِنِينَ","for the good-doers","lil'muḥ'sinīna","",[["لِّ",8],["لْ",2],["مُحْسِنِينَ",323]]]]},{"t":"Who establish prayer and give zakāh, and they, of the Hereafter, are certain [in faith].","w":[["ٱلَّذِينَ","Those who","alladhīna",""],["يُقِيمُونَ","establish","yuqīmūna","",[["يُقِيمُ",228],["ونَ",3]]],["ٱلصَّلَوٰةَ","the prayer","l-ṣalata","",[["ٱل",2],["صَّلَوٰةَ",152]]],["وَيُؤْتُونَ","and give","wayu'tūna","",[["وَ",1],["يُؤْتُ",59],["ونَ",3]]],["ٱلزَّكَوٰةَ","zakah","l-zakata","",[["ٱل",2],["زَّكَوٰةَ",363]]],["وَهُم","and they","wahum","",[["وَ",1],["هُم",3]]],["بِٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ","in the Hereafter","bil-ākhirati","",[["بِ",10],["ٱلْ",2],["ـَٔاخِرَةِ",89]]],["هُمْ","[they]","hum",""],["يُوقِنُونَ","believe firmly","yūqinūna","",[["يُوقِنُ",750],["ونَ",3]]]]},{"t":"Those are on [right] guidance from their Lord, and it is those who are the successful.","w":[["أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","Those","ulāika","",[["أُو۟لَـٰٓئِ",72],["كَ",0]]],["عَلَىٰ","(are) on","ʿalā",""],["هُدًۭى","guidance","hudan",""],["مِّن","from","min",""],["رَّبِّهِمْ","their Lord","rabbihim","ۖ",[["رَّبِّ",24],["هِمْ",3]]],["وَأُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","and those","wa-ulāika","",[["وَ",1],["أُو۟لَـٰٓئِ",72],["كَ",0]]],["هُمُ","[they]","humu",""],["ٱلْمُفْلِحُونَ","(are) the successful","l-muf'liḥūna","",[["ٱلْ",2],["مُفْلِحُونَ",695]]]]},{"t":"And of the people is he who buys the amusement of speech to mislead [others] from the way of Allāh without knowledge and who t