 a doer of good - then he has grasped the most trustworthy handhold. And to Allāh will be the outcome of [all] matters.","w":[["وَمَن","And whoever","waman","",[["وَ",1],["مَن",25]]],["يُسْلِمْ","submits","yus'lim",""],["وَجْهَهُۥٓ","his face","wajhahu","",[["وَجْهَ",178],["هُۥٓ",5]]],["إِلَى","to","ilā",""],["ٱللَّهِ","Allah","l-lahi",""],["وَهُوَ","while he","wahuwa","",[["وَ",1],["هُوَ",5]]],["مُحْسِنٌۭ","(is) a good-doer","muḥ'sinun",""],["فَقَدِ","then indeed","faqadi","",[["فَ",7],["قَدِ",37]]],["ٱسْتَمْسَكَ","he has grasped","is'tamsaka",""],["بِٱلْعُرْوَةِ","the handhold","bil-ʿur'wati","",[["بِ",10],["ٱلْ",2],["عُرْوَةِ",2522]]],["ٱلْوُثْقَىٰ","the most trustworthy","l-wuth'qā","ۗ",[["ٱلْ",2],["وُثْقَىٰ",2756]]],["وَإِلَى","And to","wa-ilā","",[["وَ",1],["إِلَى",26]]],["ٱللَّهِ","Allah","l-lahi",""],["عَـٰقِبَةُ","(is the) end","ʿāqibatu",""],["ٱلْأُمُورِ","(of) the matters","l-umūri","",[["ٱلْ",2],["أُمُورِ",82]]]]},{"t":"And whoever has disbelieved - let not his disbelief grieve you. To Us is their return, and We will inform them of what they did. Indeed, Allāh is Knowing of that within the breasts.","w":[["وَمَن","And whoever","waman","",[["وَ",1],["مَن",25]]],["كَفَرَ","disbelieves","kafara",""],["فَلَا","let not","falā","",[["فَ",7],["لَا",13]]],["يَحْزُنكَ","grieve you","yaḥzunka","",[["يَحْزُن",332],["كَ",18]]],["كُفْرُهُۥٓ","his disbelief","kuf'ruhu","ۚ",[["كُفْرُ",330],["هُۥٓ",5]]],["إِلَيْنَا","To Us","ilaynā","",[["إِلَيْ",26],["نَا",11]]],["مَرْجِعُهُمْ","(is) their return","marjiʿuhum","",[["مَرْجِعُ",603],["هُمْ",3]]],["فَنُنَبِّئُهُم","then We will inform them","fanunabbi-uhum","",[["فَ",7],["نُنَبِّئُ",265],["هُم",3]]],["بِمَا","of what","bimā","",[["بِ",10],["مَا",12]]],["عَمِلُوٓا۟","they did","ʿamilū","ۚ",[["عَمِلُ",58],["وٓا۟",3]]],["إِنَّ","Indeed","inna",""],["ٱللَّهَ","Allah","l-laha",""],["عَلِيمٌۢ","(is) the All-Knower","ʿalīmun",""],["بِذَاتِ","of what","bidhāti","",[["بِ",10],["ذَاتِ",87]]],["ٱلصُّدُورِ","(is in) the breasts","l-ṣ