es the night to enter the day and causes the day to enter the night and has subjected the sun and the moon, each running [its course] for a specified term, and that Allāh, of whatever you do, is Aware?","w":[["أَلَمْ","Do not","alam","",[["أَ",31],["لَمْ",44]]],["تَرَ","you see","tara",""],["أَنَّ","that","anna",""],["ٱللَّهَ","Allah","l-laha",""],["يُولِجُ","causes to enter","yūliju",""],["ٱلَّيْلَ","the night","al-layla","",[["ٱلَّ",2],["يْلَ",150]]],["فِى","into","fī",""],["ٱلنَّهَارِ","the day","l-nahāri","",[["ٱل",2],["نَّهَارِ",219]]],["وَيُولِجُ","and causes to enter","wayūliju","",[["وَ",1],["يُولِجُ",865]]],["ٱلنَّهَارَ","the day","l-nahāra","",[["ٱل",2],["نَّهَارَ",219]]],["فِى","into","fī",""],["ٱلَّيْلِ","the night","al-layli","",[["ٱلَّ",2],["يْلِ",150]]],["وَسَخَّرَ","and has subjected","wasakhara","",[["وَ",1],["سَخَّرَ",474]]],["ٱلشَّمْسَ","the sun","l-shamsa","",[["ٱل",2],["شَّمْسَ",354]]],["وَٱلْقَمَرَ","and the moon","wal-qamara","",[["وَ",1],["ٱلْ",2],["قَمَرَ",410]]],["كُلٌّۭ","each","kullun",""],["يَجْرِىٓ","moving","yajrī",""],["إِلَىٰٓ","for","ilā",""],["أَجَلٍۢ","a term","ajalin",""],["مُّسَمًّۭى","appointed","musamman",""],["وَأَنَّ","and that","wa-anna","",[["وَ",1],["أَنَّ",41]]],["ٱللَّهَ","Allah","l-laha",""],["بِمَا","of what","bimā","",[["بِ",10],["مَا",12]]],["تَعْمَلُونَ","you do","taʿmalūna","",[["تَعْمَلُ",58],["ونَ",4]]],["خَبِيرٌۭ","(is) All-Aware","khabīrun",""]]},{"t":"That is because Allāh is the True Reality, and that what they call upon other than Him is falsehood, and because Allāh is the Most High, the Grand.","w":[["ذَٰلِكَ","That","dhālika","",[["ذَٰ",32],["لِ",0],["كَ",0]]],["بِأَنَّ","(is) because","bi-anna","",[["بِ",10],["أَنَّ",41]]],["ٱللَّهَ","Allah","l-laha",""],["هُوَ","He","huwa",""],["ٱلْحَقُّ","(is) the Truth","l-ḥaqu","",[["ٱلْ",2],["حَقُّ",64]]],["وَأَنَّ","and that","wa-anna","",[["وَ",1],["أَنَّ",41]]],["مَا","what","mā",""],["يَدْعُونَ","they call","yadʿūna","",[["يَدْعُ",81],["ونَ",3]]],["مِن","besides